
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title> SoonX - Tailwind CSS Coming Soon HTML Page Template</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta content="SoonX - Coming Soon Tailwind CSS 3 HTML Template is a multi purpose landing page template built for any Count Down Web Page, Coming Soon Page, Launching Web, Launching Product Website, agency or business Startup. It’s fully responsive and built Tailwind v3" name="description" />
    <meta content="Getappui" name="author" />

    <!-- favicon -->
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="images/favicon.ico">

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=League+Spartan:wght@200;300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

    <!-- Tailwind css Cdn -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com" defer></script>
</head>

<body class="font-body bg-slate-100 tracking-wide">

    <section class="pb-40 lg:h-screen relative">
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <div class="overflow-hidden">
                <img class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover bg-cover bg-bottom" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0698/9398/0343/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_b19pkvb19pkvb19p.png?v=1764585655" alt="build your website image">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-lg"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
            <div class="flex xl:flex-nowrap flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-7 relative xl:pt-60 pt-20">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="md:text-5xl text-3xl text-white xl:text-start font-medium text-center max-w-lg">We are getting everything ready</h2>

                    <div id="countdown" class="my-14 z-30">
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap xl:flex-nowrap items-center gap-5">
                            <div class="h-36 w-44 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20">
                                <div class="text-center">
                                    <span id="days" class="text-3xl md:text-6xl text-white"></span>
                                    <p class="text-base font-normal text-white mt-2">Days</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="h-36 w-44 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20">
                                <div class="text-center">
                                    <span id="hours" class="text-3xl md:text-6xl text-white"></span>
                                    <p class="text-base font-normal text-white mt-2">Hours</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="h-36 w-44 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20">
                                <div class="text-center">
                                    <span id="minutes" class="text-3xl md:text-6xl text-white"></span>
                                    <p class="text-base font-normal text-white mt-2">Minutes</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="h-36 w-44 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20">
                                <div class="text-center">
                                    <span id="seconds" class="text-3xl md:text-6xl text-white"></span>
                                    <p class="text-base font-normal text-white mt-2">Seconds</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-base text-white">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-10 max-w-md mx-auto rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-md">
                    <form class="space-y-4">
                        <h3 class="text-3xl text-white">Get notified when we launch</h3>
                        <div>
                            <label for="name" class="inline-block text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer text-white mb-1">Name</label>
                            <input type="text" class="font-normal rounded block w-full text-sm px-3 py-2 bg-neutral-300/20 backdrop-blur-2xl border-0 shadow-sm text-white focus:border-gray-300 focus:ring-0 placeholder:text-gray-200" placeholder="Name">
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label for="name" class="inline-block text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer text-white mb-1">Email</label>
                            <input type="email" class="font-normal rounded block w-full text-sm px-3 py-2 bg-neutral-300/20 backdrop-blur-2xl border-0 shadow-sm text-white focus:border-gray-300 focus:ring-0 placeholder:text-gray-200" placeholder="Email">
                        </div>

                        <button class="w-full h-10 rounded uppercase text-white bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 transition-all duration-500">Notify me</button>
                    </form><!-- from End -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
     <style>
            -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    tab-size: 4;
    font-feature-settings: normal;
    font-variation-settings: normal;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
